// A bare tag label outside the expected union [F9.5]: the directed
// positions resolve a label against the expected members; a declared
// label none of them carries refuses unknown-member, never an
// inference. The escape hatch is the qualified spelling, and a label
// the head itself does not carry refuses the same way there.

tag int
tag page
tag marker
type u = int | marker
const bad: u = page
const worse: u = u::page
